

PROJECT TITLE
LEGALEASE – AI-POWERED LEGAL DOCUMENT GENERATOR

1. SYSTEM DESIGN

LegalEase follows a layered architecture consisting of a frontend, backend, AI core and document formatting modules.

2. FRONTEND

The frontend is developed using Streamlit.

It provides:

• User interface
• Input fields
• User interaction
• Document preview
• Editing options
• File download options

3. BACKEND

The backend is developed using FastAPI.

It handles:

• API requests
• Request validation
• Document generation requests
• Communication with the AI core

4. AI CORE

Google Gemini is used as the AI generation core.

It processes the user's information and generates structured legal document content based on the selected document type and provided details.

5. DOCUMENT FORMATTING

The system converts the generated AI text into different formats:

• DOCX
• PDF
• HTML preview

6. SYSTEM FLOW

User Input
↓
Streamlit Frontend
↓
FastAPI Backend
↓
Gemini AI Core
↓
Document Formatting
↓
DOCX / PDF / HTML Output

7. DESIGN OBJECTIVE

The design provides an interactive workflow for generating, editing and exporting customized legal documents.
